{{!
    @template local_oksigeniaeguahe/public_pegs

    The backpacks on the rail, one hook per child: the small backpack of the mark of Eguahe, with the first-day label on
    its pocket (the band in the colour of the centre, the name written by hand on its line, one corner peeling up). With
    no name yet, the label waits blank. Drawings only: the name is in the heading of the page.

    Example context (json):
    {"count": 1, "live": false, "pegs": [{"index": 0, "name": "Leo", "style": "", "arrive": true, "delay": "0.15",
        "hidden": false}]}
}}
<div class="perchas n{{count}}"{{#live}} data-live="1"{{/live}}>
    {{#pegs}}
    <div class="percha" data-i="{{index}}"{{#hidden}} hidden{{/hidden}}>
        <svg class="colgante" viewBox="6 13 52 64" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"{{#style}} style="{{style}}"{{/style}}>
            <path class="gancho" d="M27.6 13 L27.6 21.6 C27.6 25 29.6 27.2 32.3 27.2 C35 27.2 37 25 37 22.2 L37 21.4 C37 20.6 36.4 20 35.6 20 C34.8 20 34.2 20.6 34.2 21.4 L34.2 22.2 C34.2 23.6 33.4 24.5 32.3 24.5 C31.2 24.5 30.4 23.6 30.4 21.6 L30.4 13 Z"/>
            <g transform="translate(0.3 16)">
                <g class="mochila{{#arrive}} llega{{/arrive}}" style="animation-delay:{{delay}}s">
                    <path class="sombra" transform="translate(2 2.4)" d="M13 30 C13 21 19.5 14 28.5 14 L35.5 14 C44.5 14 51 21 51 30 L51 55.5 C51 58 49 60 46.5 60 L17.5 60 C15 60 13 58 13 55.5 Z"/>
